== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Gnome Cleric who doesn't follow Bertoxxulous, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Journey to the Abbey of Deep Musing, where [[Iony Gredlong]] awaits.  She is the Master Cleric of the Deep Muses.  Take this note to her, and she will instruct you further.

Upon handing the note to [[Iony Gredlong]]:

: [[Iony Gredlong]] says, 'Welcome to the Abbey of Deep Musing. Here you can train and raise your abilities to the peak of perfection.  Take this tunic and wear it with pride.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Ak'Anon]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Deep Muses]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Worn Felt Tunic*]]. Good luck, Cleric!

